  displayName: SHINOBI
  subtitle: Vanish, Cut, Vanish
  role: MOBILITY
  flavorText: 'A shinobi who is never where you strike.

    She blinks through enemies
    with a single cut

    and is gone before they fall -

    but she cannot take
    many hits.'
